{"3512640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "and yet, we dream", "steam_appid": 3512640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>welcome to the afterlife.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you died. hell is waiting. but an offer is made. there's one last chance to escape eternal damnation: spend a week in a middle-tier layer of the afterlife... working as a divine agent. uncover their secrets. understand their sins. decide their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a boundary-pushing visual novel where every choice is heavy and every character is a psychological puzzle. though they wear the face of skeletons, the souls you meet are more human than you can imagine, with real histories, real traumas, real anxieties, and maybe even a reflection of yourself. the conversations are so authentic because they are based on real ones. you are, in a way, speaking with real people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>deep narrative exploration</strong>: a story crafted with input from psychiatric professionals, delving into themes of morality, mortality, redemption and the human psyche.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>characters based on real psychology</strong>: meet a cast of characters built on proven personality theories and archetypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>unprecedented realism</strong>: the game's dialogues are based on transcripts of actual human conversations, with real people creating an experience of unparalleled authenticity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>choices with eternal consequences</strong>: morally complex choices with lasting impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>completely hand-drawn art</strong>: a haunting, unforgettable atmosphere unlike anything you’ve experienced before.</p></li></ul>", "